idea.pseudocode:
preregister four factorial cells, budgets, checkpoint/tie rules, and any reserved ablations
for cell in preregistered_cells:
    for category in all_four_categories:
        load unchanged split with preprocessing seed 0
        initialize matched baseline parameters with training seed 42
        initialize optional gate modules using separate seeded RNG
        for batch within epoch and GPU-second limits:
            _, sequence, positive, baseline_negative = batch
            h = baseline_causal_encoder_before_final_layernorm(sequence)
            if gated_architecture:
                for each valid position t:
                    recent = last_up_to_5_nonpadding_occurrences(sequence[:t+1])
                    older = remaining_nonpadding_occurrences(sequence[:t+1])
                    r[t] = mean(item_emb(recent))
                    if older is empty:
                        s[t] = 0; g[t] = 1
                    else:
                        s[t] = scaled_dot_attention(r[t], item_emb(older), item_emb(older))
                        g[t] = sigmoid(Linear(concat(r[t], s[t])))
                f = baseline_final_LayerNorm(h + alpha*(g*Wr(r)+(1-g)*Ws(s)))
            else:
                f = baseline_final_LayerNorm(h)
            if baseline_BCE:
                loss = unchanged_baseline_BCE(f, positive, baseline_negative)
            else:
                for each valid target position:
                    E = real_catalog minus full_user_training_history minus target
                    k = min(32, len(E))
                    if k > 0:
                        negatives = uniform_without_replacement(E, k)
                        logits = dot(f[position], item_emb([target] + negatives))
                        collect cross_entropy(logits, target_index=0)  # no logQ correction
                loss = mean(collected_losses)
            update all trainable parameters with unchanged baseline optimizer settings
        evaluate only at preregistered permitted checkpoints
        save selected category state and complete inference configuration
    record complete four-category macro validation HR@10 and actual cost
compare factorial effects and eligible complete pipelines
run compatible diagnostics within allocated budget
freeze selected pipeline; write predictor with identical model, mappings and routing

